WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.234
-Welcome back. We have such
a great show for you tonight.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.367
You know what? Before we go on,
I'm a little hungry.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.667
So if you don't mind, I'm going
to grab something right now

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.367
from the "Tonight Show" freezer
really quick.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:11.934
It'll only take a second.
Sorry about that.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:22.534
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.000
-"Freezer Secrets."

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:31.334
[ Thud]
-No!

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:34.567
Help! I'm stuck!
I'm stuck in the freezer!

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.467
-There's no use.

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.634
-Will Forte?

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:43.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.601
What are you doing here?

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:46.434
-Well, I thought this was
the bathroom.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:50.067
And I didn't realize it wasn't
until I tried to leave.

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:51.400
-This is awful.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.701
I knew it was a mistake buying
a soundproof freezer.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.834
We're doomed.
-Yeah.

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:59.834
Well, since this is the end,

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:03.667
I have a few secrets I need to
get off my chest.

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.133
-Same.

00:01:06.367 --> 00:01:09.601
One time, I finished
a box of cereal

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.400
and put the empty box
back in the cupboard.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:17.434
-I did something similar once.

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:19.133
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:22.234
You know the Trivago guy?

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:23.434
-Sure.

00:01:23.434 --> 00:01:25.901
-Well, back in 2004, me and him

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:28.067
got away with
vehicular manslaughter.

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.267
-Will, that's way worse
than what I said.

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:37.801
-Tomato, tomahto.

00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:39.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:43.067
-Tonight, during our interview,
I was going to mention how much

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:45.667
I love "MacGruber,"
but I've never seen it.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:47.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.801
-To be fair, I've never seen
"The Tonight Show."

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.934
The only show I watch is --

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:55.167
-"Cocomelon."

00:01:55.167 --> 00:02:00.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:04.801
-Whenever I go to Chipotle,
I fill my water cup with soda.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:11.234
-Whenever I go to Chipotle,
I fill my soda cup with water.

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:12.901
-Why?

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:14.367
-I'm not like the other girls.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:18.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:21.734
-I still don't understand
how NFTs work.

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.267
-NFTs don't work.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:25.601
That's the whole point.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:28.133
-Wait, what do you think NFT
stands for?

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:29.834
-Nonfunctioning testicle.

00:02:29.834 --> 00:02:31.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:35.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:38.033
And I have two of them.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.067 --> 00:02:43.868
-When we were on "SNL" together,
I thought you were an intern.

00:02:43.868 --> 00:02:46.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.634
I asked you to get me coffee
multiple times.

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:51.801
-I spit in that coffee
every time.

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:55.767
And not just a normal amount.

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:57.501
I filled that puppy to the brim.

00:02:57.501 --> 00:03:00.100
It was all spit, no coffee.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.934
I watched you drink it
and you'd say,

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:06.067
"This is the best coffee
I've ever had.

00:03:06.067 --> 00:03:07.868
Please get me another one."

00:03:07.868 --> 00:03:10.934
That's what you sound like.

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:12.701
-It really was good coffee.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:14.234
-Yeah.

00:03:14.234 --> 00:03:18.133
Hey, remember when people were
mailing anthrax to 30 Rock?

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.534
-That was you?

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:21.501
-No. It was Rachel Dratch.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:23.534
-Ah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.534 --> 00:03:25.868
My real name isn't Jimmy Fallon.

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:28.467
It's Stanley Tucci.

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:31.634
It was already taken,
so I had to change my name.

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:33.667
-My real name isn't Will Forte.

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:34.868
It's Gwyneth Paltrow.

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:36.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:40.534
And I had the idea for Goop.
Not her.

00:03:40.534 --> 00:03:42.534
-Gwyneth?

00:03:42.534 --> 00:03:44.534
Wait, I should not leave my mask
on.

00:03:44.534 --> 00:03:45.667
-Yeah, you should probably --

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:50.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:52.100
We'll be back.
-Start it over, right?

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.767
-The whole sketch.
Start the whole sketch over.

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:55.400
-Start again. Ready?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.934
-Who goes there?

00:03:57.934 --> 00:04:00.734
Should I do the "my real name
isn't Will Forte"?

00:04:00.734 --> 00:04:02.801
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:04:02.801 --> 00:04:04.667
-In 3, 2...

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:06.100
[ Thud ]

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.501
-My r--
-I--

00:04:07.501 --> 00:04:11.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:13.334
Aren't you guys freezing?

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:14.667
-Should we recast this?

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:20.167
-One more -- One more time.

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:22.234
-I'm doing the Gwyneth Paltrow
line again.

00:04:22.234 --> 00:04:23.267
-Oh, you're going to say
the line.

00:04:23.267 --> 00:04:24.167
-Yeah, he's going to say
the line.

00:04:24.167 --> 00:04:25.701
-Okay.

00:04:25.701 --> 00:04:28.467
-Smoke in this freezer.

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:31.000
-My real name isn't Will Forte.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.601
It's Gwyneth Paltrow.

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:38.167
And I had the idea for Goop.
Not her.

00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:39.934
-Gwyneth? Tucci?

00:04:39.934 --> 00:04:42.701
You guys freezing?
-Not anymore.

00:04:42.701 --> 00:04:45.334
I mean, our happiness and our
friendship has defrosted us.

00:04:45.334 --> 00:04:46.601
We're saved!

00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:48.234
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:48.234 --> 00:04:50.000
[ Clicking ]

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.834
-Wait.

00:04:51.834 --> 00:04:53.434
Do you hear that?

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:55.801
-Oh, it's nothing. Just my NFTs.

00:04:55.801 --> 00:04:57.434
[ Laughter ]
-Let's go! Come on!

00:04:57.434 --> 00:04:59.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:59.767 --> 00:05:03.000
-This has been
"Freezer Secrets."

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.300
Stick around for more
"Tonight Show" after the break.

